nt, and search for this vacancy using the Job ID or Title. Select \"Apply Now\" and provide the requested information. For full consideration, please complete the online application and submit a cover letter, CV, research paper(s), and a list of three references, including their contact information. Recommendation letters should be submitted to **ecofinRecruiting@baruch.cuny.edu** with subject Finance Position 2026-27. Applicants are required to submit a philosophy of teaching that includes but is not limited to their commitment to and experience with teaching students in a campus environment with a substantial population of students who are among the first-generation of their family to attend a college or university. **CLOSING DATE** March 15, 2027. To ensure consideration, applications must be received by December 2, 2026. **JOB SEARCH CATEGORY** CUNY Job Posting: Faculty **EQUAL EMPLOYMENT OPPORTUNITY** CUNY encourages people with disabilities, minorities, veterans and women to apply. At CUNY, Italian Americans are also included among our protected groups. Applicants and employees will not be discriminated against on the basis of any legally protected category, including sexual orientation or gender identity. EEO/AA/Vet/Disability Employer. Job ID: 32869 Location: Baruch College"
